99.68/99.76/99.80% across three runs - the overlay's emu-thread cost is
gone, matching crusnusa (99.81%) on the same box. (An earlier attempt at
this measured 80-86% and was reverted - those runs were polluted by
Defender scans of freshly built exes; the discriminating USA-vs-Exotica
pair exposed the real headroom picture.)

