Subject: [PATCH 56/88] Fix sky-through-ground on the left: backdrop cover is
 now independent

The user's driving screenshots showed the sky/horizon backdrop through
gaps in the LEFT margin terrain (blue wedges), while the right looked
clean. Cause: the margin backdrop cover shared a switch with the
margin-fill clamp-stretch, so turning fill off (it smears - correctly
defaulted off) also disabled the cover. The apparent left/right asymmetry
is explained: the right margin is now filled with real geometry by the
game-code widescreen patch, so nothing shows through there; the left
