Subject: [PATCH 85/88] The FEEL profile owns smoothing; MIDV_FFB_SMOOTH
 becomes an explicit override

The profile s smoothing was overwritten unconditionally from MIDV_FFB_SMOOTH, whose
default is 0. Two consequences, both silent: with the env unset every tune became
unfiltered, and with it set (the launcher passed 50 on every launch) all four tunes
became identical. They differ ONLY in smoothing, so the whole family was inert from
the moment it shipped. The env now applies only when actually present.

Verified per tune: @1 50ms, @2 20ms, @3 0ms, @4 80ms.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
